  "body": "- EB/logic/issue_mutations.py:_assign_one: validates org membership/role org (AssigneeValidationError → 400), update_or_create ErrorTrackingIssueAssignment (one-to-one, user or role; role deprecated but still used) or delete to unassign, writes 'assigned' activity log, returns PendingLifecycleEvent.\n- API: view actions assign and bulk(action=assign); ErrorTrackingIssueAssigneeWriteSerializer; assignee:null unassigns.\n- Notifications on assign only (not clear), sent synchronously inside the transaction: posthog/tasks/email.py:send_error_tracking_issue_assigned, EB/notifications.py:dispatch_issue_assigned_realtime.\n- Auto-assignment by rules happens in cymbal at ingestion (rules/assignment.rs); Django only does CRUD in EB/logic/rules.py.",
